HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The mmaann language first appeared as a macro package for the roff typeset‐
     ting system in Version 7 AT&T UNIX.

     The stand-alone implementation that is part of the mandoc(1) utility
     first appeared in OpenBSD 4.6.

